{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LK5b39Fg4cZTz5CCTKSqyt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tpackage com.unityinflow.sample.shipment\n2\t\n3\t/**\n4\t * A shipment raised against an order.\n5\t *\n6\t * This is the baseline (pre-benchmark) shape. BE-003 asks an agent to add a confirm\n7\t * transition; the baseline deliberately has no way to move a shipment out of [CREATED].\n8\t */\n9\tdata class Shipment(\n10\t    val shipmentId: String,\n11\t    val orderId: String,\n12\t    val carrier: String,\n13\t    val status: ShipmentStatus,\n14\t)\n15\t\n16\t/**\n17\t * The lifecycle of a shipment.\n18\t *\n19\t * [CANCELLED] is terminal. It is reachable in the fixture only by writing it directly to\n20\t * the repository — there is no cancel endpoint — which is enough for a test to set up the\n21\t * state without giving the benchmark a second unrelated feature to implement.\n22\t */\n23\tenum class ShipmentStatus {\n24\t    CREATED,\n25\t    CONFIRMED,\n26\t    CANCELLED,\n27\t}\n28\t\n29\tdata class CreateShipmentRequest(\n30\t    val shipmentId: String,\n31\t    val orderId: String,\n32\t    val carrier: String,\n33\t)\n34\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LcDmQbRtv8hUaR9r4msUvv","session_id":"1bd79e49-f141-44f7-9deb-c27270448e07","uuid":"234f5f66-c861-4e68-a41b-9f393065b137","timestamp":"2026-09-25T10:17:34.257Z","subagent_type":"implementer","task_description":"Implement BE-005 changes"}
