{"duration_api_ms":537159,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1bd79e49-f141-44f7-9deb-c27270448e07","total_cost_usd":0.6608138500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_read_input_tokens":23425,"output_tokens":1662,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":182},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1152,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":10,"output_tokens":1662,"cache_read_input_tokens":23425,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1152,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1152},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":670,"outputTokens":56248,"cacheReadInputTokens":2023541,"cacheCreationInputTokens":129349,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6608138500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":9738,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"subagent_stats":{"spawned":3,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":3},"started_in_background":3,"max_depth":1,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":3,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{"planner":1,"implementer":1,"verifier":1}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"## Delegations\n\n1. **Planner** (ac4da95bebe91dbfb): Mapped all read paths for quantities, allocation, transitions, fulfilment status, pagination, and customer validation to storage/computation locations across Order, Shipment, Customer entities and their controllers. 10 rows in table; no unresolved paths.\n\n2. **Implementer** (adcf47a931a722d6b): Implemented quantity fields, allocation constraints, shipment transitions (confirm/deliver/cancel), fulfilment status computation, quantity amendment endpoint, customer existence check (422), pagination with X-Total-Count headers, and fulfilment status filtering. Added 14 Order tests, 13 Shipment tests, 4 Customer tests. All 44 tests pass; BUILD SUCCESS.\n\n3. **Verifier** (a267bb68e29d63594): Ran tests and checked all 10 rows of planner's Read-Path Table. All rows exercised; no failing tests; 44 tests pass; BUILD SUCCESS.\n\n---\n\n## Handoffs\n\n### Planner's Table\n\n| Path | Value | Stored or Computed | Where Computed |\n|------|-------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | orderId, customerId, amount, currency, quantity | Stored | Order entity |\n| GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.allocated, delivered, status | Computed | OrderController/OrderService - aggregates shipments |\n| GET /orders?[limit]&[offset]&[fulfilment] | order array | Stored/Computed | per above |\n| GET /orders?[limit]&[offset]&[fulfilment] | X-Total-Count header | Computed | OrderRepository - counts after fulfilment filter |\n| GET /shipments/{shipmentId} | shipmentId, orderId, carrier, status, quantity | Stored | Shipment entity |\n| GET /shipments?[limit]&[offset] | shipment array | Stored | per above |\n| GET /shipments?[limit]&[offset] | X-Total-Count header | Computed | ShipmentRepository - counts before slice |\n| GET /customers/{customerId} | customerId, name, email | Stored | Customer entity |\n| GET /customers?[limit]&[offset] | customer array | Stored | per above |\n| GET /customers?[limit]&[offset] | X-Total-Count header | Computed | CustomerRepository - counts before slice |\n\n---\n\n### Implementer's Report\n\nAll requirements implemented:\n\n**Core changes:**\n- Order.quantity (default 1), Shipment.quantity (default 1), validation (HTTP 400 if <1)\n- Shipment.status extended to include DELIVERED\n- Allocation constraint on POST /shipments (HTTP 409 if exceeds order quantity)\n- Three shipment transitions: confirm (CREATED→CONFIRMED), deliver (CONFIRMED→DELIVERED), cancel (CREATED→CANCELLED)\n- Order.fulfilment computed as {allocated, delivered, status} with four states: UNALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, DELIVERED\n- PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity endpoint with allocation validation (HTTP 409 if below allocated)\n- GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS filter (HTTP 400 for invalid status)\n- GET /customers/{customerId} now throws ResourceNotFoundException through error envelope (HTTP 404)\n- POST /orders validates customer exists (HTTP 422 if not, through error envelope)\n- Pagination on GET /customers, GET /orders, GET /shipments with limit (1-100, default 100), offset (≥0, default 0)\n- X-Total-Count header on all list endpoints (count before pagination)\n- OrderControllerTest updated to create test customer before tests\n\n**Test coverage:** 44 tests total (18 Order, 18 Shipment, 7 Customer)\n- Quantity defaults, validation, customer validation (422), allocation constraints, transitions, fulfillment computation, quantity amendment, pagination, filtering, X-Total-Count header, pagination parameter validation\n\nAll tests pass; BUILD SUCCESS.\n\n---\n\n### Verifier's Report\n\n**Row-by-row test coverage:**\n\n| Row | Path | Value | Test(s) |\n|-----|------|-------|---------|\n| 1 | GET /orders/{orderId} | orderId, customerId, amount, currency, quantity | \"reads back a created order\", \"order has default quantity of 1\", \"order accepts explicit quantity\" |\n| 2 | GET /orders/{orderId} | fulfilment.allocated, delivered, status | \"order initializes with UNALLOCATED fulfillment status\" |\n| 3 | GET /orders?[limit]&[offset]&[fulfilment] | order array | \"lists orders with pagination\", \"filters orders by fulfillment status\" |\n| 4 | GET /orders?[limit]&[offset]&[fulfilment] | X-Total-Count header | \"pagination header contains total count\" |\n| 5 | GET /shipments/{shipmentId} | shipmentId, orderId, carrier, status, quantity | \"returns a shipment by id\", \"shipment has default quantity of 1\", \"shipment accepts explicit quantity\" |\n| 6 | GET /shipments?[limit]&[offset] | shipment array | \"lists shipments in id order\", \"lists shipments with pagination\" |\n| 7 | GET /shipments?[limit]&[offset] | X-Total-Count header | \"shipment pagination header contains total count\" |\n| 8 | GET /customers/{customerId} | customerId, name, email | \"reads back a created customer\" |\n| 9 | GET /customers?[limit]&[offset] | customer array | \"lists customers with pagination\" |\n| 10 | GET /customers?[limit]&[offset] | X-Total-Count header | \"customer pagination header contains total count\" |\n\n**Result:** Tests run: 44, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, BUILD SUCCESS\n\n---\n\n## Bounced\n\nNo. All 10 rows of the planner's table are exercised by tests; no test failures.\n\n---\n\n## Not Done\n\nNone. All requirements from the ticket are implemented and verified.","ttft_ms":2965,"type":"result","duration_ms":17520,"uuid":"b65d4fb5-a120-44b6-99ff-e2b2a27446cf","ttft_stream_ms":583,"time_to_request_ms":12,"first_content_frame_ms":583,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":3}

